Cell["\<\
Expands hamiltonian[s deltaK + k0] in the single scale parameter s through \
the requested total order, then sets s -> 1. The default order is 1.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->2071405873,ExpressionUUID->"526ddc65-26e8-dd4d-bcff-19ad87670c1b"],

Cell["\<\
dimensions is the ordered list of internal factors, each 2 or 3, required by \
PauliGellMannDecomposition. Returns a coefficient association rather than the \
effective matrix itself.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->835205400,ExpressionUUID->"59564e75-5efa-8c4a-9158-d6524250e678"],

Cell["\<\
Applies ComplexExpand, so symbolic momentum components are treated as real. \
Use PauliGellMannAbstract and PauliGellMannRepresent to recover a matrix \
expression.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->332072674,ExpressionUUID->"cfd22905-5983-5c4a-b8d4-bfd95b3d973d"]
}, Closed]],

